{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And as they would afflict it.</b> However much they set their heart to afflict — so the heart of the Holy One, blessed be He, was to multiply and to spread them abroad." "<b>So did he multiply.</b> So he multiplied, and so he spread abroad. And its midrash: the Holy Spirit says 'so' — you say 'lest he multiply,' and I say 'so shall he multiply' (Sotah 11)." "<b>And they were loathed.</b> They were loathed in their lifetime. And our Sages interpreted: they were like thorns in their eyes (there)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:50:05.113243559Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}